{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"850779383656218636","content":"TBH, in theory, I think Roy has the best option.  One person basically being Captain, that identifies what needs done and tries to coordinate the operations of all parts, but specialists made decisions for their area....\n\nLike a captain says \"more power\" or \"evasive maneuvers\" or \"Prioritize the smaller targets\"\n\nBut leaves the engineer to find more power, the pilot to decide what evasive maneuvers to take, or the gunner fire the cannons.  Each is left to do what they do best, and the one person at the top just calls the shots.\n\nIn practice its likely not a great government, but in theory, it would be so slick and clean","created_at":"2021-08-12T18:29:55.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"875446019255566347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
